{"words": [{"text": "وَتِلْكَ", "translation": "And this"}, {"text": "حُجَّتُنَآ", "translation": "(is) Our argument"}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَـٰهَآ", "translation": "We gave it"}, {"text": "إِبْرَٰهِيمَ", "translation": "(to) Ibrahim"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "against"}, {"text": "قَوْمِهِۦ ۚ", "translation": "his people"}, {"text": "نَرْفَعُ", "translation": "We raise"}, {"text": "دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ", "translation": "(by) degrees"}, {"text": "مَّن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "نَّشَآءُ ۗ", "translation": "We will"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "رَبَّكَ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "حَكِيمٌ", "translation": "(is) All-Wise"}, {"text": "عَلِيمٌۭ", "translation": "All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "And that was Our [conclusive] argument which We gave Abraham against his people. We raise by degrees whom We will. Indeed, your Lord is Wise and Knowing."}